<title>USA: Cyprus Amax moves up Q2 release date.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Amax moves up Q2 release date.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus Amax Minerals Co said the company and its Amax Gold Inc affiliate have advanced the release of second quarter results to July 22 from July 23.</p>
<p>Spokesman Mike Rounds said Wednesday the change was made because the original date conflicted with various travel schedules, adding these conflicts are still preventing the company from having the conference call that usually accompanies its quarterly results.</p>
<p>Rounds said the results will be released at 0700 EDT/1100 GMT July 22. ((-- Jim Brumm 212-859-1710.))</p>
</text>
